{"code":0,"data":{"count":132,"list":[{"id":235210,"wapBookId":235210,"bookName":"一号龙将","authorName":"九公子","bookPic":"https://cdn.p.yueyouxs.com/wap/235210/eb75a40a767f09eb7e22d50e3a3a7d38.jpg","fullFlag":1,"group":0,"words":2599911,"copyrightName":"阅友科技","classify":11,"classifySecond":1100,"isFee":0,"unitCprice":0,"chapterCount":1470,"extChapterCount":0,"maxFreeCount":20,"extendstr":"第1470章  终章\u003c:\u003e236680\u003c:\u003e男频/都市生活","extendstr2":"235211","latestChapterId":236680,"latestChapterName":"第1470章  终章","createTime":"2022-03-16 10:33:34","updateTime":"2024-08-10 21:39:42","state":21,"classifyName":"男频","classifySecondName":"都市人生","intro":"女儿求救，李云天身为西北军统领，一怒之下率领万千战士降临洛城。\r\n母亲惨死，好友被灭门，妻子和女儿就是他唯一的逆鳞。\r\n龙有逆鳞，处置必死。\r\n敢欺负我妻女，我要你们全都要死！\r\n\r\n【连载更新小提示：本书目前非日更，经常隔一两天更，每次更新1章。连载小说指的是作者边构思边写的书，创作需要灵感、毅力与时间，请读者大大耐心等待作者写作哟~~】"},{"id":224156,"wapBookId":224156,"bookName":"王爷，王妃貌美还克夫","authorName":"莫浅笑","bookPic":"https://cdn.p.yueyouxs.com/wap/224156/6221d84386f3a443a33322a2b845e254.jpg","fullFlag":1,"group":0,"words":1754768,"copyrightName":"星空佳创","classify":21,"classifySecond":2101,"isFee":0,"unitCprice":0,"chapterCount":634,"extChapterCount":0,"maxFreeCount":20,"extendstr":"第634章 大结局\u003c:\u003e224790\u003c:\u003e女频/穿越时空","extendstr2":"224157","latestChapterId":224790,"latestChapterName":"第634章 大结局","createTime":"2020-08-07 17:44:34","updateTime":"2021-07-26 14:45:10","state":21,"classifyName":"女频","classifySecondName":"古代言情","intro":"林卿嫣命太硬，三年克死了六个丈夫，一朝国破，她替妹妹和亲，被送上敌国的花轿。\r\n所有人都等着她把他克死，谁知他不仅没死，最后还成了九五之尊，而她——\r\n成了他掌心里的娇宠。\r\n可她却只想逃，因为他太恐怖，手段太残忍。\r\n终于有一天，他忍无可忍的把她拎入怀，声音凉薄：“再跑，腿打断！”\r\n她：你看你看，果然很凶残……"},{"id":236001,"wapBookId":236001,"bookName":"九号典当铺","authorName":"人行道","bookPic":"https://cdn.p.yueyouxs.com/wap/236001/f0937e14800957fb471f31b1b9fc9990.jpg","fullFlag":1,"group":0,"words":2391854,"copyrightName":"二层楼","classify":11,"classifySecond":1107,"isFee":0,"unitCprice":0,"chapterCount":778,"extChapterCount":0,"maxFreeCount":20,"extendstr":"第七百七十八章：回家\u003c: